{"ID":"20240513083225-5bi2ylf","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083225-5bi2ylf","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083225-5bi2ylf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513134746-70ynfr8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513134746-70ynfr8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:428,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513134746-70ynfr8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:661,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:661\u0026#125;","title":"149","type":"doc","updated":"20240515122937"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513134746-70ynfr8","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 911px;","id":"20240513134746-70ynfr8","updated":"20240515122937"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"117-12 S, T"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"男"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"58歲,胖"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"20080515"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肺積水,雙足水腫"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服前方後, 在3:00AM又會醒來, 且氣促, 但無明顯之寒熱"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 無咳嗽"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 有汗出"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 手足無麻"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. 胸口無痛"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5. 無惡寒"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6. 大便很好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7. 小便很淡,"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"量不多"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8. 雙腿仍腫，向上且腫更大了"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9. 口渴無"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈浮起,不沉,但時數時濡,一息八至"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白濕厚,紅色有點出現"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"瞳孔反應差,肺區白點"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3、觸診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"耳心點、肺點無強烈反應；督脈無壓痛"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 心陽仍無法下潛入腎, 故腎寒無法化水,肺陰實初期"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"針灸處方： 針同前穴+章門"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同5/13方加  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"川芎三錢 丹皮三錢 枳實三錢 桂枝四錢 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"壹付  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"九碗煮三碗  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"bf B/S"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.前方青龍為木生火,故服後脈上浮(現在立夏節氣，脈上浮為有利。)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.麻黃取汗,汗出但尿量未增,責之在腎"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.腎陽不足水反侮心"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→心跳快→須用炙甘草,但病人又水腫忌之"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.甘淡滲利之方仍利不出水(5/14方為5/13方去炮附子加車前子、通草、陳皮、厚朴)，故仍須由壯腎陽(真武湯)下手。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 心陽來自天陽(氧),用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黃為青龍(1)色青入肝，令木生火(2)宣肺(脈上浮)，納天陽入腎"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"。"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此人用麻黃三錢及溫陽利水藥時，睡好轉、下肢水腫退、小便量增；麻黃加至五錢，下肢水腫不退反增? Why?"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 結果得知病人家中寵物眾多,使天之清陽變成濁陽(正當春夏間寵物換毛時)，麻黃一宣肺卻吸進了濁陽，造成反效果"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→建議病人暫時更換環境以利治療"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；之後病情好轉。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 任何不可控制、預期之外的變化，必須考慮環境的影響。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}